WEBVTT

00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:30.518
or "I shall attend her here and woo her
with such spirit when she comes."

00:00:30.542 --> 00:00:31.809
(Laughter)

00:00:31.833 --> 00:00:33.434
It was all special,

00:00:33.458 --> 00:00:35.184
it was all the spotlight,

00:00:35.208 --> 00:00:37.833
and I just knew that it was for me.

00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:40.833
But somewhere along my journey,

00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:43.875
life happened.